%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
% axis
% tag  | name          | min   | def   | max
% ---------------------------------------------
% opsz | optical size  | 5.0   | 5.0   | 1200.0
% wdth | width         | 88.0  | 88.0  | 113.0
% wght | weight        | 360.0 | 360.0 | 900.0
